{"labs": [{"id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn7le15ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hi Peter!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: So, any progress on the new candidate?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Angela? I had coffee with her yesterday.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: And how is she?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, I have been thinking a lot about this question. She's very interested in breaking into the field. Angela has been very self-motivated. She has been taking courses in journalism, and she has created a very impressive portfolio.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: But ...", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn7le15ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, to tell you the truth, I've been having some doubts. She seems like a bit of an introvert. Journalism is such a fast-paced environment. If you miss an opportunity to talk to someone, you may not get your story.  She also looks a bit disorganized.  She will lose track of her ideas if she isn't well organized.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You could get to know her a bit more. She looked like she was very ambitious and pro-active.", "id": 2, "time": "28500", "image": "engenn7le15ob11re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Maybe she is. She seems reserved around new people. If she is shy, she won't be able to start conversations. They are the backbone of our livelihood. She should really think about her personality type. If she has what it takes, we would love to hire her. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I would give her a chance. Journalists can't be too outgoing. If they talk too much, they forget how to listen.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: W