ses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Present Perfect Continuous vs. Present Perfect Tenses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use these tenses  to express that an action began in the past and is still going on or has just finished. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "We use the <span class=\"italic\">Present Perfect tense</span> mainly to express that an action is completed or to emphasize the result. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Forms:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Regular verbs: form of <span class=\"italic\">have</span> + base form of verb + <span class=\"Italic\">-ed</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example: I have worked at the bakery for six years.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br/>Irregular verbs: form of <span class=\"italic\">have</span> + past participle of irregular verbs", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example: I have written a number of books in the last two years.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br/>We use the <span class=\"italic\">Present Perfect Continuous tense</span> to emphasize the duration or continuous course of an action.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Form:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Form of  <span class=\"italic\">have</span> + <span class=\"italic\">been</span> + base form of verb + <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example: We have been walking for two hours!</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Because you are talking about the continuous course of an action, you often use a time marker with Present Perfect Continuous tense, like:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>for two hours</li><li>for a long time</li><li>for ages</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Angela has been very self-motivated.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She has created a very impressive portfolio.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I have been thinking a lot about this question. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She has been taking courses in journalism.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Conditional Sentences with <span class=\"italic\">If</span>-Clauses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use conditional sentences with <span class=\"italic\">If</span>--clauses to talk about real possibilities in the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the First Conditional to say it's possible that you will do something. In that condition, something else may, will or will not happen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The parts of the sentence are divided into two clauses: the<span class=\"italic\"> If</span>-clause and the <span class=\"italic\">condition</span> clause.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The <span class=\"italic\">If</span>-clause can go at the start or the end of the sentence.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When the <span class=\"italic\">If</span>-clause starts a sentence, you separate the two clauses with a comma. When the main clause starts the sentence, you do not use a comma.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">1st Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">2nd Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If you miss an opportunity to talk to someone,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> ... you may not get your story. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible you miss an opportunity to talk to someone. In this condition: you may not get your story.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">She will lose track of her ideas  ... </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> ... if she isn't well organized.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible she isn't well organized. In this condition: she will lose track of her ideas.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "If you miss an opportunity to talk to someone, you may not get your story. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She will lose track of her ideas if she isn't well organized.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If journalists talk too much, they forget how to listen.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to break into the field", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to start working in an area", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She's very interested in breaking into the field. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words to review.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "fast-paced", "type": "name"}, {"content": "many things happening quickly or at the same time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Journalism is such a fast-paced environment.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "livelihood", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the way a person makes money to live", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Conversations are the backbone of our livelihood. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "portfolio", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a collection of documents (images, texts, etc.) a person uses to show the quality of their work", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She has created a very impressive portfolio.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "backbone", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the most important part", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Conversations are the backbone of our livelihood. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pro-active", "type": "name"}, {"content": "forward-thinking; able to anticipate problems or situations before they happen", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She looked like she was very ambitious and pro-active.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "personality type", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the way you usually act around people", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She should really think about her personality type.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob11aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "self-motivated", "type": "name"}, {"content": "describes a person who does not need other people to encourage them to do something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She has been very self-motivated. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob11aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "With a partner, select a job you want to fill.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You have 3 candidates for the job. Write a dialogue of 10 lines discussing which person is the best.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Describe each candidate's personality.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Give your opinion about each person.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use the expressions: <span class=\"italic\">\u201cDoes he/she have what it takes?\u201d</span>, <span class=\"italic\">\u201cI have been thinking\u201d</span> and <span class=\"italic\">\u201cbreak into the field\u201d</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a decision.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice reading the dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Change roles.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I describe personality.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give my opinion.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use appropriate expressions about work.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}